{% comment %}
  Central structured data (JSON-LD) dispatcher.

  Emits page-type-appropriate schema.org markup, mirroring the structured data
  served by the legacy ediblearrangements.com site (parity migration).
  Rendered once from layout/theme.liquid <head>.

  Each block lives in its own snippet for readability:
    - every page -> structured-data-organization  (Organization, sitewide)
    - collection -> structured-data-collection     (CollectionPage > ItemList)
    - product    -> structured-data-product        (ProductGroup > hasVariant)
    - blog       -> structured-data-blog           ([ Blog, BreadcrumbList ])
    - article    -> structured-data-article        (Article)
{% endcomment %}

{%- render 'structured-data-organization' -%}

{%- case request.page_type -%}
  {%- when 'collection' -%}
    {%- render 'structured-data-collection' -%}
  {%- when 'product' -%}
    {%- render 'structured-data-product' -%}
  {%- when 'blog' -%}
    {%- render 'structured-data-blog' -%}
  {%- when 'article' -%}
    {%- render 'structured-data-article' -%}
{%- endcase -%}
